!docs/architecture/m15-03*.md
!docs/architecture/m15-03*.json
!docs/architecture/m15-03-evidence/
docs/architecture/m15-03-evidence/*
!docs/architecture/m15-03-evidence/*.png
!docs/architecture/m15-03-evidence/*.json
